[gd_scene load_steps=7 format=3]

; CLUSTER ROUND — one 40mm carrier shell, built to fit the launcher's chamber.
;
; SIZED OFF THE CHAMBER, not off a guess. cluster_launcher_model.tscn chambers
; are CylinderMesh r 0.1, h 0.94, so the body sits at r 0.085 with a rim at 0.098
; and the whole round is 0.80 long: it fills the bore it goes into and still
; slides, and the rim stands proud of the drum face the way a loaded round does.
;
; BUILT ALONG +Y, like every CylinderMesh, and placed with the chamber's own
; basis so it lies down the bore. The nose is the fat ogive of a low-velocity
; grenade rather than a bullet point — this is a thing that is lobbed, and the
; silhouette should say so at the moment it is being loaded, which is the only
; time the player ever sees one up close.

